24:["$","p","For the listed January deadline, Geneva is on CET, UTC+1: 23:59 Geneva corresponds to 22:59 UTC on 21 January 2027. Write both the owner’s time zone and your own local equivalent in your private plan. Leave enough time for document or connection problems; opening a form near the cutoff is not a completed application.",{"children":"For the listed January deadline, Geneva is on CET, UTC+1: 23:59 Geneva corresponds to 22:59 UTC on 21 January 2027. Write both the owner’s time zone and your own local equivalent in your private plan. Leave enough time for document or connection problems; opening a form near the cutoff is not a completed application."}]
25:["$","p","Save the exact vacancy reference beside your draft. A search snippet or an archived guide is weaker evidence than the current owner listing. If the body, linked form or offer does not match the cycle you intend, resolve that mismatch before entering personal information.",{"children":"Save the exact vacancy reference beside your draft. A search snippet or an archived guide is weaker evidence than the current owner listing. If the body, linked form or offer does not match the cycle you intend, resolve that mismatch before entering personal information."}]
