28:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Compare the research task before choosing the programme",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Compare the research task before choosing the programme"}],[["$","p","CERN’s general Summer Studentship overview describes scientific or technical project work and an eight-to-thirteen-week association. The openlab programme describes a nine-week computing-focused placement. Its programme page lists 21 or 28 June 2027 starts. Vacancy summary cards also use a two-month contract label; confirm your actual approved dates and duration in the final offer rather than deriving them from that card alone.",{"children":"CERN’s general Summer Studentship overview describes scientific or technical project work and an eight-to-thirteen-week association. The openlab programme describes a nine-week computing-focused placement. Its programme page lists 21 or 28 June 2027 starts. Vacancy summary cards also use a two-month contract label; confirm your actual approved dates and duration in the final offer rather than deriving them from that card alone."}],["$","p","A computing student can see plausible work in both routes. That does not make the applications interchangeable. Read the department/project description, identify the methods you can contribute and state what you want to learn. A familiar programme name is not evidence of a project match.",{"children":"A computing student can see plausible work in both routes. That does not make the applications interchangeable. Read the department/project description, identify the methods you can contribute and state what you want to learn. A familiar programme name is not evidence of a project match."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Compare the research task before choosing the programme","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Compare the research task before choosing the programme"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Your immediate research interest",{"scope":"col","children":"Your immediate research interest"}],["$","th","First route to investigate",{"scope":"col","children":"First route to investigate"}],["$","th","Evidence to develop",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence to develop"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"A question spanning physics, engineering, mathematics or computing"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Read the standard vacancy and its scientific/technical scope"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"A genuine project or course contribution connected to the work"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"A strong computing profile seeking advanced computing work"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Read the openlab vacancy and programme description"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Concrete programming, systems, data or analysis work you can explain"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Check the study conditions without treating this guide as an eligibility result",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the study conditions without treating this guide as an eligibility result"}],[["$","p","The current vacancies specify bachelor’s/master’s study rather than PhD candidature, at least six completed full-time semesters by the summer start, continued full-time enrolment during the placement, English ability and restrictions on previous CERN participation. The exact field requirement and full conditions belong to the selected vacancy. Check each one rather than assuming that meeting the semester condition is sufficient.",{"children":"The current vacancies specify bachelor’s/master’s study rather than PhD candidature, at least six completed full-time semesters by the summer start, continued full-time enrolment during the placement, English ability and restrictions on previous CERN participation. The exact field requirement and full conditions belong to the selected vacancy. Check each one rather than assuming that meeting the semester condition is sufficient."}],"$L2c","$L2d"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31"]}]
